 "sentences": [
  "These rocks look like they point toward stars.",
  "Vasquez Rocks in California feature sedimentary strata tilted at an average of 50 degrees.",
  "Tectonic forces near the San Andreas Fault caused this dramatic deformation over millions of years.",
  "Erosion later sculpted these resistant sandstone fins.",
  "Their otherworldly appearance made them a classic filming location for Star Trek.",
  "Producers also used this desert landscape for Westworld and Battlestar Galactica."
